-----
  Most likely cause: your Supabase project is paused. Free-tier Supabase projects auto-pause after 1 week of inactivity.

  Fix:
  1. Go to https://supabase.com → sign in → open your project
  2. If there's a banner saying "Project paused" — click Restore project (takes ~30 seconds)
  3. Try sign-in again

  If the project isn't paused, check:
  - Is the server running the new build? After copying the new files to cPanel, you must restart the Node process —
  otherwise it still runs the old build
  - In cPanel → Terminal (or Node.js App Manager) → restart the app

  ---
  Now, here's a summary of everything that was done for the flyer update:

  What was built:

  guests_per_unit system — Couples and Group tiers now generate the correct number of individual tickets automatically.
  Set it when creating tiers in the admin:
  - Single → 1
  - Couples → 2
  - Group of 10 → 10

  Purchase form redesign — now shows:
  - Numbered steps (Step 1 / 2 / 3) — much clearer for non-tech users
  - "Couples package · 2 guests" badge on bundle tiers
  - "2 couples = 4 guests total" live count as they change quantity
  - Klarna / Clearpay / PayPal / Card payment badges
  - "Pay in installments with Klarna or Clearpay at checkout" hint near the total

  Klarna & Clearpay — no code change needed beyond the logos. Since your Stripe session doesn't restrict payment
  methods, they'll show automatically once you enable them in:
  Stripe Dashboard → Settings → Payment methods → enable Klarna + Clearpay

  New migration SQL (supabase/migrations/0003_guests_per_unit.sql) — run this in Supabase SQL Editor before creating the
   Winter Ball event.

  Winter Ball event — create it in admin with these details:

  ┌────────────┬─────────────────────────┐
  │   Field    │          Value          │
  ├────────────┼─────────────────────────┤
  │ Name       │ Winter Masquerade Ball  │
  ├────────────┼─────────────────────────┤
  │ Slug       │ winter-masquerade-ball  │
  ├────────────┼─────────────────────────┤
  │ Date       │ 28 Nov 2026, 18:00      │
  ├────────────┼─────────────────────────┤
  │ End        │ 29 Nov 2026, 02:00      │
  ├────────────┼─────────────────────────┤
  │ Venue      │ Grand Sapphire          │
  ├────────────┼─────────────────────────┤
  │ Address    │ Grand Sapphire, Croydon │
  ├────────────┼─────────────────────────┤
  │ Dress code │ Masquerade ball attire  │
  └────────────┴─────────────────────────┘

  Then add 4 tiers — for Couples set guests_per_unit = 2, for Group of 10 set guests_per_unit = 10.